    "dispatch": "Byte 1 opcode; byte 3 subcode for length >=5; byte 4 modifier for length >=6. Width byte 2 is not consulted for mnemonic selection. Basic length 3/4 headers share identity. Python only projects observed families in length 3..6; unsupported modifiers remain opaque.",
